<li>Kecepatan menanjak: 7.37 m/s (1,450 ft/min)</li>
<li>Tinggi: 8.72 m (28 ft 7 in)</li>
<li>Berat kosong: 11,204 kg (24,650 lb)</li>
<li>Berat maksimum take off: 19,773 kg (43,500 lb)</li>
<li>Mesin: 2 Rolls-Royce Dart Mk.532-7 turboprop, 1,678 kW (2,250 eshp).</li>
